<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9389] Concurrent Cache#close and put/get operations lead to a deadlock</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9389</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When cache is closed on a client node,&#160;while it is being used concurrently in other threads, deadlock may occur.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test case, reproducing the problem is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
